# client/ is a fork of pipensx (https://github.com/i3sey/pipensx, GPL-3.0 -
# see client/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md) with our own catalog source + branding
# on top. Its vendor/ tree (Borealis + glm + zstd + libnx-ext + jech/dht +
# libutp + qrcodegen, ~190MB with submodules) is not committed - fetch it
# with:
#   cd client && git init -q && git submodule add https://github.com/XITRIX/borealis.git vendor/borealis && ...
# Simplest in practice: clone pipensx fresh with --recurse-submodules and
# copy its vendor/ directory in - see client/BUILD.md.
client/vendor/

# Bundled catalog snapshot for offline first launch (see
# client/CMakeLists.txt's PIPENSX_CATALOG_SNAPSHOT) - large (~35MB) and
# regenerated from the live sources at any time, not meant to churn git
# history on every catalog refresh.
client/resources/catalog/
